racking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1290821,\"title\":\"Shelter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cv7DeQQ7TOozPoTCBdNJIvWKhU1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHxWyy18SvAZ8jJeemtS8k1UNjM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man living in self-imposed exile on a remote island rescues a young girl from a violent storm, setting off a chain of events that forces him out of seclusion to protect her from enemies tied to his past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1280738,\"title\":\"The Furious\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ivQ1Z3lI1xWvAeGDHBw3CCYZDGJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1AVF2fAevpfi2HP6AEpptG1kg8R.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Wang Wei's daughter is abducted by a criminal organization and law enforcement declines to intervene due to corruption, Wei embarks on a solo mission to find her. His sole ally is Navin, a determined journalist whose wife has also mysteriously disappeared. Together, this improbable pair confronts the kidnappers in a fierce martial arts confrontation, driven by an intense desire for 